---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
	title="Elimination Method | Pair of Linear Equations | Class 10 Mathematics | The Concepts Adda"
	description="Learn how to solve a pair of linear equations using the Elimination Method by equating coefficients with solved NCERT examples."
>
	<main class="lesson-page">
		<div class="lesson-container">
			<a href="/linear-equations" class="back-link">
				<span class="back-arrow">←</span>
				<span>Back to Linear Equations</span>
			</a>

			<!-- LESSON HEADER -->
			<section class="lesson-header">
				<div class="lesson-number">03</div>
				<div class="lesson-header-copy">
					<div class="lesson-label">LESSON 03 · CLASS 10 MATHEMATICS (NCERT)</div>
					<h1>Algebraic Method — <span>Elimination</span></h1>
					<p>
						Master the elimination method by multiplying equations to make coefficients of one variable equal and eliminating it.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CONTENT LAYOUT -->
			<section class="content-layout">
				<article class="lesson-content">

					<!-- 01 · THE ALGORITHM -->
					<div class="topic-label">01 · THE METHOD</div>
					<h2>Steps for Elimination Method</h2>
					<p>
						The elimination method eliminates one variable by making its coefficients equal in both equations:
					</p>

					<div class="summary-list">
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>Step 1</span>
							<p>Multiply one or both equations by suitable non-zero constants so that coefficients of one variable become numerically equal.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>Step 2</span>
							<p><strong>Add or subtract</strong> the equations to eliminate that variable, giving an equation in one variable.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>Step 3</span>
							<p>Solve for the remaining variable, then substitute back into any original equation to find the second variable.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 02 · SOLVED NCERT EXAMPLES -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">02 · SOLVED NCERT EXAMPLES</div>
					<h2>Step-by-Step Problem Solving</h2>

					<!-- Example 1 -->
					<div class="example-card">
						<div class="example-header">
							<span class="example-badge">EXAMPLE 1</span>
							<h3>Solve 9x - 4y = 2000 and 7x - 3y = 2000 using Elimination</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="example-solution">
							<p><strong>Step 1: Multiply to make y coefficients equal</strong>:</p>
							<p>Multiply Eq(1) by 3: <em>27x - 12y = 6000</em> &nbsp;— (3)</p>
							<p>Multiply Eq(2) by 4: <em>28x - 12y = 8000</em> &nbsp;— (4)</p>

							<p style="margin-top:14px;"><strong>Step 2: Subtract Eq(3) from Eq(4) to eliminate y</strong>:</p>
							<div class="calc-box">
								(28x - 12y) - (27x - 12y) = 8000 - 6000<br/>
								<strong>x = 2000</strong>
							</div>

							<p style="margin-top:14px;"><strong>Step 3: Substitute x = 2000 in Eq(1)</strong>:</p>
							<div class="calc-box">
								9(2000) - 4y = 2000<br/>
								18000 - 4y = 2000 ⟹ 4y = 16000<br/>
								<strong>y = 4000</strong>
							</div>

							<p style="margin-top:12px;">Solution: <strong>x = 2000</strong> and <strong>y = 4000</strong>.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Example 2 -->
					<div class="example-card">
						<div class="example-header">
							<span class="example-badge">EXAMPLE 2 (NCERT WORD PROBLEM)</span>
							<h3>Sum of digits problem</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="example-solution">
							<p><strong>Problem:</strong> The sum of a two-digit number and the number obtained by reversing the digits is 66. If the digits differ by 2, find the number.</p>
							<p style="margin-top:10px;">Let tens digit = <em>x</em> and units digit = <em>y</em>. Number = <em>10x + y</em>.</p>
							<p>Reversed number = <em>10y + x</em>.</p>
							<div class="calc-box">
								(10x + y) + (10y + x) = 66<br/>
								11x + 11y = 66 ⟹ <strong>x + y = 6</strong> &nbsp;— (1)
							</div>
							<p style="margin-top:10px;">If x - y = 2, adding (1) and (2) gives 2x = 8 ⟹ <strong>x = 4, y = 2</strong>.</p>
							<p style="margin-top:8px;">The numbers are <strong>42</strong> or <strong>24</strong>.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 03 · QUICK SUMMARY -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">03 · QUICK SUMMARY</div>
					<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>

					<div class="summary-list">
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>01</span>
							<p>If signs of the variable to be eliminated are <strong>opposite</strong>, <strong>ADD</strong> the equations.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>02</span>
							<p>If signs of the variable to be eliminated are <strong>same</strong>, <strong>SUBTRACT</strong> the equations.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>03</span>
							<p>Elimination is usually faster than substitution for equations with integer coefficients!</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- LESSON NAVIGATION -->
					<div class="lesson-navigation">
						<a href="/linear-equations/substitution-method" class="previous-lesson">
							<span>←</span>
							<div>
								<small>PREVIOUS LESSON</small>
								<strong>Substitution Method</strong>
							</div>
						</a>

						<a href="/linear-equations/pyqs" class="next-lesson">
							<div>
								<small>NEXT LESSON</small>
								<strong>Previous Year PYQs</strong>
							</div>
							<span>→</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- SIDEBAR -->
				<aside class="lesson-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-card">
						<div class="sidebar-title">LINEAR EQUATIONS</div>
						<div class="progress-text">Lesson 03 of 04</div>
						<div class="progress-bar">
							<div style="width: 75%;"></div>
						</div>

						<div class="sidebar-lessons">
							<a href="/linear-equations/graphical-method" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>01</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Graphical & Ratio Test</strong>
									<small>Consistency & solution cases</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/linear-equations/substitution-method" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>02</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Substitution Method</strong>
									<small>Algebraic substitution</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/linear-equations/elimination-method" class="sidebar-lesson active">
								<span>03</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Elimination Method</strong>
									<small>Equating coefficients</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/linear-equations/pyqs" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>04</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Previous Year PYQs</strong>
									<small>CBSE 2020-2024 practice set</small>
								</div>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<style>
		.lesson-page {
			min-height: 100vh;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #ffffff 35%, #f7f9fc 100%);
			color: #14213d;
			padding: 45px 0 100px;
		}

		.lesson-container {
			width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
			margin: 0 auto;
		}

		.back-link {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 7px;
			color: #667085;
			text-decoration: none;
			font-size: 14px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin-bottom: 35px;
			transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
		}

		.back-link:hover {
			color: #2563eb;
			transform: translateX(-3px);
		}

		.lesson-header {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: 25px;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 40px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			border-radius: 24px;
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
			box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.055);
			margin-bottom: 45px;
		}

		.lesson-number {
			width: 80px;
			height: 80px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			border-radius: 20px;
			background: #eef4ff;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 23px;
			font-weight: 900;
		}

		.lesson-label {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 850;
			letter-spacing: 1.7px;
			margin-bottom: 10px;
		}

		.lesson-header h1 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 54px);
			line-height: 1.05;
			letter-spacing: -2px;
			font-weight: 900;
			color: #14213d;
		}

		.lesson-header h1 span {
			color: #2563eb;
		}

		.lesson-header p {
			margin: 15px 0 0;
			max-width: 720px;
			color: #687180;
			font-size: 17px;
			line-height: 1.65;
		}

		.content-layout {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
			gap: 45px;
			align-items: start;
		}

		.lesson-content {
			min-width: 0;
			padding: 5px 0 0;
		}

		.topic-label {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1.8px;
			margin-bottom: 14px;
		}

		.second-label {
			margin-top: 60px;
		}

		.lesson-content h2 {
			margin: 0;
			color: #14213d;
			font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px);
			line-height: 1.1;
			letter-spacing: -1.5px;
			font-weight: 900;
		}

		.lesson-content > p {
			max-width: 780px;
			margin: 18px 0 0;
			color: #687180;
			font-size: 16.5px;
			line-height: 1.75;
		}

		.example-card {
			margin-top: 25px;
			border-radius: 20px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			background: #ffffff;
			box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.035);
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		.example-header {
			padding: 20px 24px;
			background: #f8fafc;
			border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
		}

		.example-badge {
			display: inline-block;
			padding: 4px 12px;
			border-radius: 6px;
			background: #2563eb;
			color: #ffffff;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		.example-header h3 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 18px;
			font-weight: 800;
			color: #14213d;
		}

		.example-solution {
			padding: 24px;
			color: #475569;
			font-size: 15px;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.calc-box {
			margin-top: 10px;
			padding: 14px 18px;
			border-radius: 12px;
			background: #0f172a;
			color: #38bdf8;
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 15px;
			font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
		}

		.summary-list {
			display: grid;
			gap: 16px;
			margin-top: 26px;
		}

		.summary-item {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 20px;
			padding: 20px 24px;
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: #ffffff;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.03);
		}

		.summary-item span {
			padding: 8px 14px;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: #eef4ff;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-weight: 900;
			font-size: 13px;
			flex-shrink: 0;
		}

		.summary-item p {
			margin: 0;
			color: #334155;
			font-size: 15.5px;
			line-height: 1.5;
			font-weight: 600;
		}

		.lesson-navigation {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 20px;
			margin-top: 60px;
			padding-top: 40px;
			border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		}

		.previous-lesson,
		.next-lesson {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 16px;
			padding: 18px 24px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: #ffffff;
			text-decoration: none;
			color: #14213d;
			transition: all 0.2s ease;
		}

		.next-lesson {
			margin-left: auto;
			text-align: right;
			justify-content: flex-end;
		}

		.previous-lesson:hover,
		.next-lesson:hover {
			border-color: #2563eb;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
			transform: translateY(-2px);
		}

		.previous-lesson div,
		.next-lesson div {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.previous-lesson small,
		.next-lesson small {
			display: block;
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			margin-bottom: 4px;
		}

		.previous-lesson strong,
		.next-lesson strong {
			display: block;
			font-size: 15px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #0f172a;
		}

		.previous-lesson span,
		.next-lesson span {
			font-size: 20px;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-weight: 800;
		}

		.lesson-sidebar {
			position: sticky;
			top: 30px;
		}

		.sidebar-card {
			padding: 28px;
			border-radius: 24px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			background: #ffffff;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.04);
		}

		.sidebar-title {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1.5px;
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		.progress-text {
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin-bottom: 12px;
		}

		.progress-bar {
			height: 6px;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: #e2e8f0;
			overflow: hidden;
			margin-bottom: 24px;
		}

		.progress-bar div {
			height: 100%;
			background: #2563eb;
			border-radius: 10px;
		}

		.sidebar-lessons {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 8px;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson {
			display: flex;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 12px;
			padding: 12px;
			border-radius: 12px;
			text-decoration: none;
			color: #334155;
			transition: background 0.15s ease;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson:hover {
			background: #f8fafc;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active {
			background: #eef4ff;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson > span {
			width: 24px;
			height: 24px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			flex-shrink: 0;
			border-radius: 6px;
			background: #f1f5f9;
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active > span {
			background: #dbeafe;
			color: #2563eb;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson div {
			min-width: 0;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson strong {
			display: block;
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #1e293b;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active strong {
			color: #1d4ed8;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson small {
			display: block;
			font-size: 11px;
			color: #64748b;
			margin-top: 3px;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active small {
			color: #3b82f6;
		}

		@media (max-width: 900px) {
			.content-layout {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.lesson-header {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				padding: 28px;
			}

			.lesson-number {
				width: 60px;
				height: 60px;
				font-size: 18px;
			}

			.lesson-navigation {
				flex-direction: column;
			}

			.next-lesson {
				width: 100%;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
